'''June Bride of the Devil''' (悪魔のジューンブライド, ''Akuma no Jūn Buraido'', '''June Bride of the Devil''') is the June event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 11.6 Update|Version 11.6]]. '''#02 Banquet of Terror''' was added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]], while the '''Weekend Honeymoon''' stages were added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]].

==Event Information==
You are cordially invited to a fright-filled wedding!<br>
Survive a new terrifying encounter with the malevolent bride each week!<br>
{{Color|#CC4125|'''On from July 10th (11:00 AM) until July 31st (10:59 AM)!'''}}

{{Color|#980000|'''● Limited "June Bride of the Devil" Event Capsules!'''}}<br>
Exchange limited Holy Water items for awesome rewards from the Event Capsules!<br>
{{Color|#9900FF|'''New Special unit Invisible Cat'''}} is up for grabs!

Rewards: {{Color|#38761D|'''4 limited units, XP, battle items, etc.'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> The Event Capsules can only be used with Event Tickets earned in-game.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Event Capsules will be unavailable after the event ends and Event Tickets will be unusable.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Extra Event Tickets cannot be converted into items or XP.

{{Color|#CC4125|'''・Limited June Bride event stages!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Clear rewards reset'''}} for all returning event stages!

Visit the Legend/Event stages in The Battle Cats app during this event to challenge frightening limited maps!

{{Color|#CC4125|'''● Gauntlet Map: "#01 The Ghost Chapel"'''}}<br>
Will YOU survive your haunted encounters in the Ghost Chapel?!

Rewards: {{Color|#00AA00|'''Holy Water'''}}

※Once all stage attempts have been used, you will be able to retry after a certain amount of time has passed.<br>
※Using a Catamin A will immediately grant another stage attempt.

{{Color|#CC4125|'''・Limited Stage: "#02 Banquet of Terror"'''}}<br>
A sinister shadow falls over the wedding reception…

Timed Score Rewards: {{Color|#00AA00|'''Rare Ticket, Holy Water, etc.'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Check available rewards and point requirements by tapping Timed Score at the bottom left of the map screen.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited Stage: "#03 ??? the 13th"'''}}<br>
Steel your nerves and get ready for a honeymoon at the foggy lake! What paranormal events will you find yourself involved in?

The rare appearance of a continuation stage rewards {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Holy Water'''}} upon stage clear!

Reward: {{Color|#4A86E8|'''XP'''}}<br>
{{Color|#CC4125|'''On from July 17th (11:00 AM) until July 31st (10:59 AM)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited Map: "#04 Yowling Village"'''}}<br>
In a hidden village beyond the limits of cell signal, a boundless terror lurks!

Timed Score Rewards: {{Color|#00AA00|'''Cat Ticket, XP, battle items'''}}<br>
{{Color|#CC4125|'''On from July 24th (11:00 AM) until July 31st (10:59 AM)!'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Check available rewards and point requirements by tapping Timed Score at the bottom left of the map screen.

{{Color|#CC4125|'''・Weekend Honeymoon Stages Available!'''}}<br>
A visit to a village for a honeymoon turns into avoiding becoming a sacrifice in a terrifying town!<br>
Can you escape this village of horrors safely…?!

{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Weekend Honeymoon Week 1'''}}<br>
Rewards: {{Color|#00AA00|'''Purple Behemoth Stone, Holy Water'''}}<br>
On from July 10th (11:00 AM) until July 12th (11:59 PM)!

{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Weekend Honeymoon Week 2'''}}<br>
Rewards: {{Color|#00AA00|'''Red Behemoth Stone, Holy Water'''}}<br>
On from July 17th (12:00 AM) until July 19th (11:59 PM)!

{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Weekend Honeymoon Final Week'''}}<br>
Rewards: {{Color|#00AA00|'''Rare Ticket, Holy Water'''}}<br>
{{Color|#CC4125|'''On from July 24th (12:00 AM) until July 26th (11:59 PM)!'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> This stage will appear after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 1, and can be challenged after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 3.

{{Color|#CC4125|'''・Limited Missions and login stamps!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''June Bride of the Devil Special Missions'''}}<br>
Rewards: {{Color|#00AA00|'''Rare Ticket, Behemoth Stones (Red, Purple), Holy Water'''}}, etc.

{{Color|#4A86E8|'''June Bride of the Devil Login Stamps (up to 21)'''}}<br>
Rewards: {{Color|#00AA00|'''Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, Holy Water'''}}, etc.

<nowiki>*</nowiki> You must claim rewards from cleared Special missions before the event ends. Even if mission objectives have been met, rewards cannot be claimed after the mission disappears.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Some Missions are only available after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 3.

