==Trivia==
*The second Japanese event poster for #01 The Ghost Chapel reveals that [[Director Kurosawah]] directed "The Sleepless Peng", a movie that [[Condemned Peng]] is known to have starred in.
*The name "#04 Yowling Village" is likely a reference to the horror movie ''[[wikipedia:ja:犬鳴村 (映画)|HOWLING VILLAGE]]'', titled "犬鳴村" in Japanese.
*<nowiki>#</nowiki>04 Yowling Village's stages are remakes of the floors of the [[Citadel#Zombie|Zombie Citadel]], with the major difference being the addition of [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku Enemies]] and the [[Ghost Doge|Ecto]] [[Ghost Snache|Ga]][[Ghost Baa Baa|ng]].
*Mistakenly, the 2023 event information mentions the [[Heartbeat Catcademy (Event Gacha)|Heartbeat Catcademy]] Gacha rather than [[June Bride of the Devil (Event Gacha)|June Bride of the Devil]] Gacha.
**Additionally, it also mentions obtaining Undead Cat from said Gacha despite being removed.

